{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\" version=\"1.0\" datamodel=\"ecmascript\" initial=\"a\">\n  <datamodel><data id=\"x\" expr=\"1\"/></datamodel>\n  <state id=\"a\"><onentry><if cond=\"x == 1\"><log expr=\"'one'\"/><else/><log expr=\"'other'\"/><elseif cond=\"x == 2\"/><log expr=\"'two'\"/></if></onentry>\n  <transition event=\"go\" target=\"f\"/></state><final id=\"f\"/>\n</scxml>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/xsd-if-branch-order.scxml"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":1,"notes":0,"total":1,"warnings":0},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/xsd-if-branch-order.scxml"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":0,"byteOffset":208,"endColumn":63,"endLine":3,"startColumn":63,"startLine":3},"insertedContent":{"text":"<elseif cond=\"x == 2\"/><log expr=\"'two'\"/>"}},{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":42,"byteOffset":236,"endColumn":133,"endLine":3,"startColumn":91,"startLine":3},"insertedContent":{"text":""}}]}],"description":{"text":"move the `<elseif>` branch before `<else>`"},"properties":{"applicability":"maybe-incorrect"}}],"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/xsd-if-branch-order.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":98,"endLine":3,"startColumn":92,"startLine":3}}}],"message":{"markdown":"`<elseif>` is not allowed here inside `<if>`\n\n**Note:** the W3C SCXML 1.0 schema rejects this under XML Schema constraint `cvc-complex-type.2.4`: Element 'elseif' is not allowed at this position in the content model\n\n**Help:** `<else>` must be the last branch of `<if>`: move this `<elseif>` and its content before `<else>`\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §4.4 <elseif>\n\n**Spec:** XML Schema 1.0 Part 1 §3.4.4 Element Locally Valid (Complex Type) (`cvc-complex-type.2.4`)","text":"`<elseif>` is not allowed here inside `<if>`"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":243,"start":237},"category":"schema"},"relatedLocations":[{"id":1,"message":{"text":"in the content of this `<if>`"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/xsd-if-branch-order.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":29,"endLine":3,"startColumn":27,"startLine":3}}},{"id":2,"message":{"text":"`<else>` starts the last branch here"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/xsd-if-branch-order.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":68,"endLine":3,"startColumn":64,"startLine":3}}}],"ruleId":"XSD-cvc-complex-type.2.4"}],"tool":{"driver":{"informationUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/","name":"scxml-validator","rules":[{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"each SCXML element has a fixed content model; for example executable content belongs only in `<onentry>`, `<onexit>`, and `<transition>`"},"help":{"text":"How to fix: move the element to a parent that accepts it, or add the missing children.\n\nSpecification: XML Schema 1.0 Part 1 §3.4.4 Element Locally Valid (Complex Type)\n\nRun `scxml-cli --explain XSD-cvc-complex-type.2.4` for examples."},"helpUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/xmlschema-1/#cvc-complex-type","id":"XSD-cvc-complex-type.2.4","name":"XSD-cvc-complex-type.2.4","properties":{"category":"schema"},"shortDescription":{"text":"a child element is not allowed at this position, or required children are missing"}}],"semanticVersion":"0.2.0"}}}],"version":"2.1.0"}